[I] XML The Perl Way

[T] XML::Twig is a Perl XML transformation module that offers a tree
[T] interface while still being able to process huge documents chunk by
[T] chunk. It is not bound by DOM or SAX, provides a comprehensive set of
[T] perlish methods and comes with tools such as xml_pp and xml_grep.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/XML-Twig

